#Alameda Creek Simulation -- GSFLOW
HEAD PRINT FORMAT   4
DRAWDOWN PRINT FORMAT   0
HEAD SAVE UNIT 58
PERIOD   1 STEP   1   
    PRINT BUDGET
    SAVE BUDGET   
PERIOD   2 STEP   1   
    PRINT BUDGET   
PERIOD   2 STEP   20   
    PRINT BUDGET   
PERIOD   2 STEP   50   
    PRINT BUDGET   
PERIOD   2 STEP   100  
    PRINT BUDGET   
    SAVE HEAD